%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% Scenario: a closed branch and a second level. A part whose count is
% negative is closed: its two children are nested under it but hidden,
% so the outline root counts only the two top-level items, and the
% part's own count in the document is the negative of what opening it
% would show. One child has a view of its own; the appendix names
% page 2.
[ /Title (Part) /Count -2 /OUT pdfmark
[ /Title (One) /View [/FitH 700] /OUT pdfmark
[ /Title (Two) /Count 0 /OUT pdfmark
[ /Title (Appendix) /Page 2 /View [/XYZ 0 792 1] /OUT pdfmark
72 700 moveto 300 700 lineto stroke
showpage
72 600 moveto 300 600 lineto stroke
showpage
